message: "If you use the workflow, the papers, or the formalization, please cite as below."
title: "set-math-ablaze: a verification-first workflow for research mathematics, with papers and a Lean formalization"
abstract: >-
  A checker that makes the strength of every mathematical claim a
  machine-readable attribute, the procedure it enforces, three papers written
  under that procedure, and the Lean 4 formalization of one of their results.
